{"3970380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "E-legal: Darknet Syndicate", "steam_appid": 3970380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a cybercrime simulation that forces you to climb from nothing to the top of the underworld. Your goal is to build your own illegal empire while battling both the police and rival mafias.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Getting Started:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your first job is to host an illegal website on the clear net. To do this, you’ll need to secretly connect your <strong>single-board computers </strong>to public ethernet ports in hidden locations. But be careful: if the police trace one of your devices, they could take down your entire network in a chain reaction. The choice is yours—remove the device, destroy it remotely, or leave it at risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970380/extras/dfcb7800a603e6978f89799be3d67a0a.poster.avif?t=1777543043\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970380/extras/dfcb7800a603e6978f89799be3d67a0a.webm?t=1777543043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970380/extras/dfcb7800a603e6978f89799be3d67a0a.mp4?t=1777543043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crypto &amp; Money Laundering:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest your earnings into crypto, build mining rigs to multiply your income, or manipulate the market for high-stakes plays. Prices are constantly shifting—cash out at the wrong time, and you could go bankrupt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underground Economy:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy your own servers, rent them out, run a black market, or dive into new cybercrimes. Every profit brings bigger risks, bigger enemies, and bigger opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies &amp; Threats:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other mobs see you as competition and will try to eliminate you. The police are always on your trail. Will you defend yourself—or strike first? The strategy is yours to choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change music from your phone, smoke a cigarette against the night city skyline, invest in a luxurious lifestyle. Every detail immerses you in building your cybercrime empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a cybercrime simulation that forces you to climb from nothing to the top of the underworld. Your goal is to build your own illegal empire while battling both the police and rival mafias.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Getting Started:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your first job is to host an illegal website on the clear net. To do this, you’ll need to secretly connect your <strong>single-board computers </strong>to public ethernet ports in hidden locations. But be careful: if the police trace one of your devices, they could take down your entire network in a chain reaction. The choice is yours—remove the device, destroy it remotely, or leave it at risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970380/extras/dfcb7800a603e6978f89799be3d67a0a.poster.avif?t=1777543043\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970380/extras/dfcb7800a603e6978f89799be3d67a0a.webm?t=1777543043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970380/extras/dfcb7800a603e6978f89799be3d67a0a.mp4?t=1777543043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crypto &amp; Money Laundering:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest your earnings into crypto, build mining rigs to multiply your income, or manipulate the market for high-stakes plays. Prices are constantly shifting—cash out at the wrong time, and you could go bankrupt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underground Economy:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy your own servers, rent them out, run a black market, or dive into new cybercrimes. Every profit brings bigger risks, bigger enemies, and bigger opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies &amp; Threats:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other mobs see you as competition and will try to eliminate you. The police are always on your trail. Will you defend yourself—or strike first? The strategy is yours to choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change music from your phone, smoke a cigarette against the night city skyline, invest in a luxurious lifestyle. Every detail immerses you in building your cybercrime empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Step into the dark world of cybercrime. Build your own network, outsmart the police and rival mobs, make a fortune on the crypto exchange—or lose everything.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970380/fa74868b155faad1e8b9ba5f9fcde23c6563c1b1/header.jpg?t=1777543043", "capsule_image": "https